":"vndb","value":"A"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"150"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"71"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"55"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"電気も電話も水道もガスも通っていないドが付く田舎育ちで、現代社会の常識が思いっきり欠けている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"代々八城家の【蛇の頭】に仕える神官の家系であり、当代の礼一が男であることから巫女としてその子供を身籠もりにやって来た。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"山野を走って通学していた野生児であり、見た目からは想像も付かない化け物じみた体力を有している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"基本、雑食。通常食べないようなものまで食べてしまう。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"山奥の一軒家で祖父母に愛されて育ったため、あまり疑うことを知らない上に、天然で無邪気。ただし、おバカ。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"礼一に子作りを迫ることに対しては、小さい頃からそれが当然と育てられてきたため、羞恥心などはあまりなく、大好き！　と想っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「らみあはね、れーちゃんと繁殖して子供作りに来たのっ♪」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14450","sourceWorkId":"13016","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ド田舎から都会に彷徨いこんだ、純真無垢で元気いっぱいの女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかしてその正体は、代々八城家の 『蛇の頭』 に仕える巫女として、礼一の子種を狙う天然無邪気なピュアモンスター！"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「らみあはね、れーちゃんと子供作りしに来たのっ！」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55060"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"70 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14450","sourceWorkId":"13016","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"a","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14450","sourceWorkId":"13016","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"150 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14450","sourceWorkId":"13016","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"71 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14450","sourceWorkId":"13016","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"55 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14450","sourceWorkId":"13016","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/1598c4ccccf92ad1fa94d57db394565490f65ab473150746318f32def39988f5.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/4e/4e284ba8a631ad775726bec544a18b866fc41e3e9e763de20b9781b22127c16a.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"倉田まりや","creatorId":"vndb:s789","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s789","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s789","name":"澄田 まりや","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:131036:55060:6018:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c30738","characterName":"御手洗 スセリ","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"55061","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"131036"}],"egsCharacterIds":["14451"],"vndbCharacterId":"c30738"},"originalCharacterName":"御手洗 スセリ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"ab"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"73"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"153"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"74"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"らみあとは逆の大神に仕えて八城家の【蛇の頭】を滅ぼす側の巫女で、幼馴染み。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人は幼馴染みと言われることを嫌い、腐れ縁としている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"何より家の関係から始まり、そのへそ曲がり気質からか、らみあを一方的にライバル視し、見下している。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"らみあの家よりは少しだけ近代化され水道は通っていて、そのことを拠り所に都会人ぶり、らみあと一緒にされることを非常に嫌がる。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"頭の回転は速いがせっかちで早とちりをよくする上に、意地っ張りなので、勘違いし引っ込みが付かなくなって失敗することが多い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"幼い頃から、らみあと同様に【蛇の頭】を妊娠する役目を叩き込まれてはいるものの、内心釈然としないものを抱えている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"が、らみあへの対抗心もあり、役目をしっかり果たそうと内心を押し込めている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんなスセリなので、当然礼一には冷たいが……。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「まったく、お役目とはいえ、こんなのと子作りするなんて……はぁ～」"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14451","sourceWorkId":"13016","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"八城家の 『蛇の頭』 を滅ぼす側の巫女の末裔にして、らみあの 幼馴染み 腐れ縁。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"才色兼備なスセリのお眼鏡に、礼一はお世辞にも叶うとは言えないこの複雑な心中。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"でもでもっ。そんな生意気小生意気。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「良かったですわね。私みたいな美少女とエッチ出来て」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"55061"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"73 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14451","sourceWorkId":"13016","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"罩杯（本版本）","value":"b","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14451","sourceWorkId":"13016","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"153 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14451","sourceWorkId":"13016","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"74 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14451","sourceWorkId":"13016","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"14451","sourceWorkId":"13016","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/2b/2b00923f5060b929e5432abd93de9cb922acf0e223b860d597190daf3c853056.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/5f/5f781e4a25b0be5a776a59a3d5c8571748f1c5fccccd7d6bf9ddfc15f0cea7b9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"大久保藍子","creatorId":"vndb:s361","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s361","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s361","name":"大久保 藍子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"ba